{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120494","id":3904742126,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7ovaLu","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120494","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120494.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120494.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120494","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120494/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120494/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120494/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/e3434a6a767fb4a21109c4997c21f3e73475a58c","number":120494,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Editor: Fix crash when right-clicking properties/categories in Project Manajer","user":{"login":"DylanXB","id":294323078,"node_id":"U_kgDOEYsDhg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/294323078?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DylanXB","html_url":"https://github.com/DylanXB","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DylanXB/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DylanXB/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DylanXB/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DylanXB/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DylanXB/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DylanXB/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DylanXB/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DylanXB/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DylanXB/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fix crash when right-clicking settings/categories in Project Manager\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nOpening the **Editor Settings** / **Edit All Settings** dialog from within the **Project Manager** (before any project is loaded) and right-clicking any setting or category causes the engine to crash immediately with a segmentation fault (`SIGSEGV`).\r\n\r\nThis occurs because key singletons and data structures are not initialized when running the Project Manager context:\r\n1. **`EditorHelp::get_doc_data()`**: Returns `nullptr` since documentation data is only loaded in the full editor context.\r\n2. **`EditorContextMenuPluginManager::get_singleton()`**: Returns `nullptr` since it is initialized later by `EditorNode::init()`.\r\n\r\nWhen a user right-clicked a setting property or category header in this state, the engine attempted to access these pointers directly without safety checks, leading to null-pointer dereferences (e.g., checking documentation availability via `class_list.has()` or trying to append custom plugin context options).\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nThis PR adds defensive checks across `editor/inspector/editor_inspector.cpp` to ensure these systems are valid before accessing them:\r\n\r\n- **`EditorInspectorCategory::_popup_context_menu`**: Only appends \"Open Documentation\" if `ScriptEditor::get_singleton()` and `EditorNode::get_singleton()` are valid, and `EditorHelp::get_doc_data()` does not return `nullptr`.\r\n- **`EditorProperty::_update_popup`**: Only attempts to call `add_options_from_plugins(...)` if the context menu plugin manager is non-null.\r\n- **`EditorProperty::menu_option`**: Protects the fallback options against a null `EditorContextMenuPluginManager` singleton.\r\n- **Property Tooltips**: Added `if (dd)` checks around lines accessing `EditorHelp::get_doc_data()` during tooltip resolving.\r\n\r\n### How to Test\r\n1. Launch Godot and remain on the **Project Manager** window.\r\n2. Click the **Settings** gear icon in the top right and choose **Edit All Settings**.\r\n3. Right-click any category header (e.g., *Interface*) or individual property field.\r\n4. **Result**: A clean context menu appears safely without the \"Open Documentation\" option, and the engine no longer crashes.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1327318271,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzI3MzE4Mjcx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/crash","name":"crash","description":"","color":"885544","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-06-20T18:44:09Z","updated_at":"2026-07-10T19:11:41Z","closed_at":"2026-07-10T19:11:36Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"DylanXB:fix-pm-crash","ref":"fix-pm-crash","repo":{"id":1275472827,"node_id":"R_kgDOTAYruw","name":"godot","full_name":"DylanXB/godot","owner":{"login":"DylanXB","id":294323078,"node_id":"U_kgDOEYsDhg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/294323078?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DylanXB","html_url":"https://github.com/DylanXB","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DylanXB/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DylanXB/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DylanXB/gists{